.iv.session":"The session","iiu.iv.reflection.note":"About your own conduct — did you ask the questions in order, was your manner respectful and autonomy-supporting? This is about you, not about the candidate.","iiu.iv.finish":"End the interview","iiu.iv.completed.title":"The interview is completed","iiu.iv.sess.srprefix":"Session","iiu.iv.sess.paused":"Paused","iiu.iv.sess.completed":"Completed","iiu.iv.sess.inprogress":"In progress","iiu.iv.peacestep":"Conversation phase","iiu.iv.saved":"Saved","iiu.iv.notes":"Notes","iiu.iv.notes.hint":"This is working material, not evidence and not an assessment. Evidence is confirmed after the interview. Saved automatically.","iiu.iv.completed.body":"The next step is choosing the material from your notes — suggestions can be produced for you to confirm, edit or reject — and then assessing against the role's requirements.","iiu.iv.completed.body.manual":"The next step is choosing the material from your notes and then assessing against the role's requirements.","iiu.iv.toevidence":"Go to assessment","iiu.pp.item.focus_area":"Focus area","iiu.pp.item.relevant_experience":"Relevant experience","iiu.pp.item.missing_information":"Missing information","iiu.pp.item.ambiguity":"Ambiguity","iiu.pp.item.verification_point":"Verification point","iiu.pp.sourcefailed":"The material could not be saved","iiu.pp.s1.title":"1. Material","iiu.pp.item.probe":"Follow-up question","iiu.pp.item.clarification":"Clarification","iiu.pp.item.prohibited_reminder":"Reminder","iiu.pp.basis.default":"Legitimate interest, recruitment.","iiu.pp.contenthash":"Locked content hash","iiu.pp.s1.body":"Each source is split into citable passages. AI may only state things about the candidate that point back to such a passage.","iiu.pp.nosources":"No material has been added yet.","iiu.pp.purpose":"purpose","iiu.pp.addsource":"Add material","iiu.pp.type":"Type","iiu.pp.label":"Label","iiu.pp.content":"Content","iiu.pp.contenthint":"Paste the text as it is. It is used as