 gets the same questions.","iiu.pp.manual.default.timeplan":"Opening 5 min · The guide's questions 40 min · Candidate's questions and close 10 min","iiu.pp.guide.show":"Show the interview guide ({n} questions)","iiu.pp.manual.default.closing":"Ask whether the candidate has questions, explain the next steps and when they will hear back, and thank them.","iiu.pp.manual.body":"Write a short plan for how you will conduct it. The questions and follow-up questions come unchanged from the interview guide.","iiu.pp.manual.timeplan":"Time plan","iiu.pp.manual.opening":"Opening","iiu.pp.manual.closing":"Closing","iiu.pp.manual.save":"Save the plan","iiu.rp.final":"Final and immutable","iiu.rp.hash":"Content hash","iiu.rp.remaining":"Before the report can be completed","iiu.rp.noblockers":"Everything AI suggested has been reviewed by a person, and every question has an assessment.","iiu.rp.noblockers.manual":"Every question has an assessment and all evidence is human-confirmed.","iiu.rp.failed":"The report could not be completed","iiu.rp.confirm":"Confirm that the report should be completed","iiu.rp.confirm.body":"A completed report is immutable. A later change requires a new version, and this one is preserved.","iiu.rp.finalising":"Completing …","iiu.rp.finalise":"Complete the report","iiu.rp.final.body":"The report rests solely on evidence a named person has confirmed and on human assessments. An AI suggestion cannot reach this point.","iiu.rp.locked":"Locked content","iiu.rp.packhash":"Package content hash","iiu.rp.humanassessment":"Human assessment","iiu.rp.confirmedevidence":"confirmed evidence","iiu.rp.outstanding":"Outstanding and to verify","iiu.rp.quality.note":"Measures of how the interview was conducted and how complete the material is. Nothing here measures the candidate, and nothing is compared between candidates.","iiu.rp.m.answered":"Questions answered","iiu.rp.m.dimensions":"Dimensions with confirmed evidence","iiu.rp.m.corrected":"AI suggestions corrected","iiu.rp.m.awaiting":"Awaiting review","iiu.rp.m.level0":"Insufficient evidence (level 0)","iiu.rp.m.assessors":"Assessors","iiu.rp.traceability":"Traceability","iiu.rp.nohistory":"No history yet.","iiu.rp.historycaption":"Event history for the interview","iiu.rp.event":"Event","iiu.rp.actor":"Performed by","iiu.rp.actor.human":"Person","iiu.pl.state.individual":"Individual assessment in progress","iiu.pl.state.revealed":"The assessments are open","iiu.pl.state.closed":"The panel is closed","iiu.pl.intro":"Each assessor makes their own assessment first, without seeing the others. When everyone has submitted, the assessments open at the same time. The panel then weighs them together in writing — there is no average and no vote.","iiu.pl.none.title":"No panel is open for this interview","iiu.pl.none.body":"A panel is opened with at least two assessors from your organisation. A single assessor needs no panel — that is an ordinary assessment, made on the Evidence page.","iiu.pl.assessors":"Assessors","iiu.pl.submitted":"Has submitted","iiu.pl.stillassessing":"Still assessing","iiu.pl.sealed.title":"The assessments are sealed","iiu.pl.sealed.body":"You see only your own assessments until everyone has submitted. That is deliberate: once you have seen a colleague's level, you cannot un-know it.","iiu.pl.mine":"Your assessments","iiu.pl.perquestion":"Assessments per question","iiu.pl.noassessments":"No assessments to show yet.","iiu.pl.disagree":"The assessors assess differently","iiu.pl.actionfailed":"The action could not be completed","iiu.pl.submit.title":"Submit your own assessment","iiu.pl.submit.body":"You can submit once you have assessed every core question. After that you will see the others' assessments when everyone is finished.","iiu.pl.submitting":"Submitting …","iiu.pl.submitcta":"Submit my assessment","iiu.pl.allsubmitted":"Everyone has submitted","iiu.pl.reveal.body":"Open the assessments so the panel can discuss them.","iiu.pl.revealing":"Opening …","iiu.pl.revealcta":"Open the assessments","iiu.pl.conclusion.hint":"Write what the panel concluded and why, including where you disagreed. There is no average and no vote — the conclusion is reasoning, not a number.","iiu.pl.humanwritten":"Written by a person. The individual assessments above remain unchanged.","iiu.pp.approve.blockedTitle":"The plan cannot be approved right now","iiu.pp.approve.blockedBody":"The application this interview belongs to could not be read, so the role, its requirements and any shared assessment material are unknown. Approving the plan now would be approving it against material that was never fetched. Re-read above and try again.","iiu.new.prefill":"Taken from the application. Change it if the interview needs another internal name.","iiu.new.fromApplication":"Started from an application","iiu.new.err.title":"Enter a title for the interview.","iiu.new.err.candidate":"Enter the candidate's name or reference.","iiu.new.err.pack":"Choose an interview guide.","iiu.new.lead":"The interview is locked to an exact version of the interview guide. A later change to the guide therefore never affects an interview in progress or a finished report.","iiu.new.notactive":"Your company account is not active right now, so new interviews cannot be started. Interviews already under way and finished reports remain. Contact the platform.","iiu.new.nopacks":"No interview guide is available right now. Guides are made available by the platform — try again later, or contact the platform if you expect one here.","iiu.new.candidatehint":"Used to identify this record internally.","iiu.new.choosepack":"Choose an interview guide …","iiu.new.pilot.title":"This interview guide is a pilot hypothesis","iiu.new.pilot.body":"The content is a considered hypothesis that has not yet been content-validated through documented job analysis and an expert panel. It may be used in a controlled pilot and as interview support, but no scientific or predictive claims may be made about it.","iiu.new.failed":"The interview could not be created","iiu.new.title":"Plan an interview","iiu.new.field.title":"Internal title","iiu.new.field.candidate":"Candidate (name or reference)","iiu.new.field.pack":"Interview guide for the role","iiu.new.create":"Plan the interview","iiu.new.creating":"Creating …","iiu.new.cancel":"Cancel","iiu.ix.lead":"Prepare the interview, document the conversation and bring together the evidence for your assessment. You assess and decide.","iiu.ix.title":"Interview Intelligence","iiu.ix.heading":"Interviews","iiu.ev.notes.title":"Your interview notes","iiu.ev.notes.body":"Everything you wrote during the interview follows you here automatically, under its own question. You never have to retype it. A note is source material — it becomes evidence only when you confirm it.","iiu.ev.notes.none":"No note was recorded for this question.","iiu.ev.notes.kind":"Note type","iiu.ev.notes.source":"Source: interview note","iiu.ev.analyse":"Suggest material from the notes","iiu.ev.analysing":"Analysing …","iiu.ev.analyse.body":"Reads your notes and suggests delimited extracts. Nothing becomes material until you confirm it.","iiu.ev.analyse.steps":"What was done","iiu.ev.step.ok":"Done","iiu.ev.step.failed":"Failed","iiu.ev.step.abstained":"Declined","iiu.ev.partial":"Partly done. What succeeded is still here — your notes are untouched and you can continue manually.","iiu.ev.task.evidence_extraction":"Propose evidence from the notes","iiu.ev.task.evidence_dimension_mapping":"Link proposals to evidence dimensions","iiu.ev.task.gap_and_contradiction_detection":"Find gaps and contradictions","iiu.ev.task.enter_evidence_review":"Move to review","iiu.ev.fromnote":"From your note","iiu.ev.proposed":"The AI's proposed extract","iiu.ev.5e.title":"5E — how the account holds together","iiu.ev.5e.note":"5E is CQrityjob's way of structuring an account so you can see which parts are actually present. It is not a score and not a prediction of job performance. An empty fie